Body:
This is my current `opencode debug config`. The MCP entries were added after the error and were not active during the affected session. At the time, my source config contained only the `$schema` field, with no `provider`, `model`, `agent`, `plugin`, or `mcp` overrides.

The timestamps confirm this:
- `~/.local/share/opencode/log/opencode.log` records the errors at `2026-07-16T07:50:11Z` and `2026-07-16T07:53:29Z`.
- OpenCode’s `apply_patch` tool call records the MCP block being added at `2026-07-16T19:20:26Z`. The diff shows that the previous config contained only `$schema`.
- The config file’s modification time is `2026-07-16 15:20:26 -0400`, equivalent to `19:20:26Z`, corroborating the tool-call record.

Thus, the MCP configuration was added approximately 11 hours and 27 minutes after the errors. The affected session was effectively using the default configuration.

